{"repositoryId":1277795285,"availability":"available","full":"rossoctl/context-guru","name":"context-guru","description":"Context optimization for AI coding agents — lower token cost and latency without sacrificing accuracy.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":69,"forks":24,"created":"2026-06-23T07:38:30Z","updated":"2026-10-15T14:58:30Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://rossoctl.github.io/context-guru/","topics":["agentic-ai","ai","ai-agents","claude-code","claude-code-plugin","codex","codex-plugin","context-engineering","context-management","golang","llm","llm-agents","llm-inference","mcp","prompt-caching","skills"],"demo":"https://rossoctl.github.io/context-guru/#demo","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:34.541Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:34.541Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:34.541Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T15:00:34.541Z","stars":69,"forks":24}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Provider-agnostic context engineering for LLM agents.","context-guru cuts the token cost of your agent's traffic in two ways: carry less context (drop redundant tool output, collapse superseded runs, summarize before you hit the limit), and pay less for what you still carry (keep your prompt cache warm, split the volatile tail off the system prompt so the rest stays cacheable). Paying less is the default — it's on out of the box, before you opt into anything that trims content."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rossoctl/context-guru/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ea0afd9b502d60bdd95cacc522574a166167e24a6b183d186b0be06e088801d8","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:34.672Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:34.672Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Provider-agnostic context engineering for LLM agents.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rossoctl/context-guru/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fing